       ("A program, not a posting calendar", "<p>Strategy sets the point of view and the offers. Content production keeps a cadence the team can actually sustain. Community management treats replies as the product, not an afterthought. Paid social amplifies what the audience already proved it likes, and creator partnerships layer in where local trust closes the sale. Reporting ties it back to the business monthly, in plain language. The products behind this thinking, including Magpie, live in Extra Medium Labs.</p>"),
